    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 7.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Twa and twentig ðusend punda goldes ⁊ seolfres man gesealde ðam here of Ænglalande wið friðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">22,000 in gold and silver have been paid out of England to the (Viking) fleet as the price of the truce.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Uiginti duo milia librarum auri et argenti data fuerunt exercitui de Anglia pro pace.</ab>
      </div>
